<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml" xmlns:ttp="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#parameter" xmlns:tts="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#styling" xml:lang="en" ttp:timeBase="media" ttp:cellResolution="32 15"><head><metadata><ttm:title>Addicted To You</ttm:title><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1">Huddy</ttm:agent><ttm:item type="album">Addicted To You</ttm:item><ttm:item type="spotify_id">6ukeayt0xBnECOOesWOAm7</ttm:item></metadata><styling><style xml:id="s1" tts:color="#FFFFFF" tts:fontSize="100%" tts:textAlign="center" tts:fontFamily="sansSerif" tts:fontStyle="normal" tts:fontWeight="bold" /><style xml:id="bg_vocal" tts:color="#A0A0A0" tts:fontStyle="italic" /></styling><layout><region xml:id="r1" tts:origin="10% 10%" tts:extent="80% 80%" tts:displayAlign="center" /></layout></head><body><div><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作词: "},{"tx":"Chase Hudson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Andrew Luce"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Linus Hablot"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">{"c":[{"tx":"作曲: "},{"tx":"Chase Hudson"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Andrew Luce"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Linus Hablot"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Jacob Brown"},{"tx":"/"},{"tx":"Joshua Conerly"}]}</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 1]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Contemplating your temptations</p><p ttm:agent="v1">They yell at us but we won't listen</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pull me close and now we're kissin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You've always been my addiction</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Send me to the stars above</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I would kill for you, my love</p><p ttm:agent="v1">To see your smile when I wake up</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Oh, I can't get enough</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She said: "I like your style and your tattoos"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The very first night that I met you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanted to impress you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You stole my heart and I let you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's hold on a little longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pretend it's the last day on Earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the end it doesn't matter</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Causе I'm so addicted to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm so addicted to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Causе I'm so addicted to you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Verse 2]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You make me out, it's too easy</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You're my escape, without no reason</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the way (Way), you touch my face (Face)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You numb my pain</p><p ttm:agent="v1">When I'm feelin' like I'm dyin'</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I need you one more time</p><p ttm:agent="v1">And more than ever, now or never</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Just one last breath</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She said: "I like your style and your tattoos"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The very first night that I met you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanted to impress you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You stole my heart and I let you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's hold on a little longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pretend it's the last day on Earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the end it doesn't matter</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm so addicted to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm so addicted to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="role" itunes:value="background">('Cause I'm so addicted to you)</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Instrumental Bridge]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">[Chorus]</p><p ttm:agent="v1">She said: "I like your style and your tattoos"</p><p ttm:agent="v1">The very first night that I met you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">I just wanted to impress you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">You stole my heart and I let you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Let's hold on a little longer</p><p ttm:agent="v1">Pretend it's the last day on Earth</p><p ttm:agent="v1">In the end it doesn't matter</p><p ttm:agent="v1">'Cause I'm so addicted to you</p><p ttm:agent="v1">i’m addicted to your love even though it’s poison shot me in the eyes with cupids boy yeah i can’t run away this the only life for me now</p></div></body></tt>